Initial OCR batch stopped when the parent agent moved the full source PDFs and page images outside the distributable package, while the batch was running. Original source paths no longer existed. Pages 20 and 21 had already been visually checked. The helper now uses external_sources/C_independent_primary, restricts itself to the relevant three pages, limits OCR threading, and outputs metadata rather than reproducing source pages. The corrected rerun is e_push_C_ocr.out.
